SUMMARY:Cancelled - Trancend Band at Sierra Nevada Brewery- unhosted event
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\n**Hey y’all. I got a message that bot
 h singers for the band are under the weather. This event is cancelled. Sor
 ry for any inconvenience**\n\n**Hey y’all! The local Alternative Rock Gr
 oup Trancend will have a live show on the Amphitheater stage Saturday Nove
 mber 7th at Sierra Nevada Brewery! The show starts at 4:00! Come out and h
 ear this great high energy band! You won’t be disappointed!**\n\n**This 
 will be an unhosted event as I and Eileen will both be away. I’m sure th
 at some of our group will be there for this show.**\n\n**When you arrive f
 or the show\, please post in the chat where you’re located so others in 
 the group can find you**\n\n**TrancEnd is an alt-rock band based out of We
 stern NC/Upstate SC\, covering 90’s\, 2000’s AND MORE!**\n\n**https://
 sierranevada.com/event/trancend-band-5**\n\n**https://sierranevada.com/abo
 ut-us**
