SUMMARY:Wild Wing Social Mix and Mingle w/ live music
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\nHey y'all! Let's meet out at Wild Wing 
 Cafe South Asheville for some time to connect\, hang out\, see old friends
 \, and make some new ones!!\n\nThere will be live music by The Commodore F
 ox Band later in the evening.\n\nLet's meet out at 6:00 pm for a social ti
 me before the band takes the stage\n\n**The Commodore Fox Band is a high
 ‑energy\, crowd‑pleasing party band led by Commodore Anders\, known fo
 r playing rock and dance hits from the 1970s\, 80s\, and beyond\, and for 
 performing at community festivals\, parks\, and private events across Nort
 h Carolina.**\n\n### About the Band\n\nThe Commodore Fox Band is described
  as “toeing the line as your favorite party band\,” delivering a mix o
 f classic rock\, disco\, pop\, and dance tracks that get people moving. Ba
 nd leader **Commodore Anders** and his crew are noted for aiming to please
  audiences with a set that blends nostalgic favorites with contemporary hi
 ts. They are a recurring feature at local events\, often highly requested 
 by organizers\n\n## About Wild Wing Cafe\n\nWild Wing Cafe is a popular sp
 ot known for friendly staff\, efficient counter service\, easy access\, co
 nsistent flavor across the menu\, welcoming dining vibes\, quick turnaroun
 d\, barista-level beverages\, repeat guests who keep coming back and fresh
  flavors. People frequently mention burgers\, fries that hit the spot\, ho
 t plates\, solid flavor and consistency and good coffee and drinks. Good t
 o know: parking is easier off-peak. Wild Wing Cafe keeps guests coming bac
 k for relaxed meals like burgers and burgers. Guests describe Wild Wing Ca
 fe with phrases like wild wing cafe\, local favorite\, repeat visitors\, f
 riendly staff\, fresh flavors\, casual ambience.
